{"title":"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Problem_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Problem_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the result of adding seven to the result of forty divided by one-half.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each valve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, when open, releases water into a tank at its own constant rate. With all three valves open, the tank fills in 1 hour, with only valves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> open it takes 1.5 hours, and with only valves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> open it takes 2 hours. How many hours will it take to fill the tank with only valves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> open?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Julie has a 12 foot by 20 foot garden. She wants to put fencing around it to keep out the neighbour’s dog. Normal fenceposts cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3b9e046c83ca25ffa3c15f213a16571b36a47b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />2 each while strong ones cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3b9e046c83ca25ffa3c15f213a16571b36a47b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />3 each. If Julie needs one fencepost for every 2 feet and has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3b9e046c83ca25ffa3c15f213a16571b36a47b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />70 to spend on fenceposts, what is the greatest number of strong fenceposts she can buy?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is a real polynomial of degree at most 3. Suppose there are four distinct solutions to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> = 7. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/a/a1aee44ddb2534126ce0796022542da4e7d095ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"34\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7f12a14e88d709e2eb0e05d7f12bee6a17ecd22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f \\colon \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> be defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d277edbb9670043042d0dc7cd8e704cbf2bc6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) =\\begin{cases}2 &amp;  \\text{if }x = 0, \\\\(f(x-1))^2 &amp;  \\text{if }x \\neq 0 \\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"242\" height=\"53\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/e/49e67a600d43642696cd7f882af62a907e609380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2f(11)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 5\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If for three distinct positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699fbbff2c70d9bcc266368e9aea9ea16aa1c488.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{y}{x+z} = \\frac{x+y}{z} = \\frac{x}{y}\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"39\" /> \nThen find the numerical value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e32f96b310bbe6cd6981b6c1da83fe7905ea3116.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"12\" height=\"36\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 6\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3428847b35b09cb78983db4d340fb553e378ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_A B + \\log_B A = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/c/35c6befbae2835211a36a77a5e2708937cc6faac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&lt;B$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90ce1667f4a2dbfd7c125fe0a2ca1004bfbf141b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_B A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 7\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/c/a5c5c9ffa54b4a203c08ba33e38cd621ca90d22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\frac{1}{2+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{2+\\frac{1}{1+\\cdots}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -32px\" width=\"137\" height=\"57\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 8\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/1383b544e86c5696786f91bba42e0eaf8493c2c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)(x - 1)(x + 3)(x + 5) = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"265\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 9\">Solution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/a/83a6bd32e3dcfac4dc5c00307b33414a06a2f9f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x+y+z &amp;= 3\\\\ x^2+y^2+z^2 &amp;= 5\\\\ x^3+y^3+z^3 &amp;= 7\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"128\" height=\"71\" />\nFind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/923fee2f79eaf668d0e0ac36d7e05806c9e10123.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+y^4+z^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 10\">Solution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stanford_Mathematics_Tournament\" title=\"Stanford Mathematics Tournament\">Stanford Mathematics Tournament</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stanford_Mathematics_Tournament_Problems\" title=\"Stanford Mathematics Tournament Problems\">SMT Problems and Solutions</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT\" title=\"2001 SMT\">2001 SMT</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra\" title=\"2001 SMT/Algebra\">2001 SMT/Algebra</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018045258\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 207/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6022/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<